      "detail": "Below ~240 Hz the room's modes dominate. Lowest axial modes: 44, 45, 63, 88, 91, 126 Hz; modes nearly on top of each other at 44/45 Hz, 88/91 Hz, 132/136 Hz boom on those notes; the biggest gap between modes is 40 Hz, so some notes are weak. 125 Hz rings for 0.29 s.",
